{"ID":"20240118151104-3bseflp","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151104-3bseflp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151104-3bseflp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151104-c9nwx3v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135957-coz45bo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135957-coz45bo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:119,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:119\u0026#125;","title":"227羚羊角","type":"doc","updated":"20240201174933"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151104-c9nwx3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151104-c9nwx3v","updated":"20240122135923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，寒，无毒。主明目，益气，起阴，去恶血，注下，辟蛊毒，恶鬼，不祥，安心气，常不魇寐。外服强筋骨，轻身。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135926-vpkxhl3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135926-vpkxhl3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产非洲，我国蒙古等地。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135932-djo5mbz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135932-djo5mbz","updated":"20240122135934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸，性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135935-sc4q8it","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135935-sc4q8it"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】羚羊角为清热，明目，强筋骨，起阴气药，治伤寒，热病寒热，中风附骨痛，产后恶血动心，食噎及惊痫，能抑低血压，防止脑溢血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135938-5iuompx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135938-5iuompx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗伤寒时气寒热，热在肌肤，湿风注毒伏在骨间，食噎不通，久服强筋骨，轻身，起阴益气，利丈夫。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135940-u1l77sv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135940-u1l77sv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【孟铣】治中风筋挛，附骨疼痛，作末蜜服治卒热闷，及热毒，利血，疝气，磨水涂肿毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135941-1kotin2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135941-1kotin2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】治惊悸烦闷，心胸恶气，瘰疬恶疮，溪毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135942-dlkfvwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135942-dlkfvwd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】羚羊挂树干而眠，身悬而能眠，因其筋最直，故能治筋缩抽扯之症，角尤精气之所在，故性微寒，功专舒筋，本天水之阴，以清热也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135944-0fxi5dd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135944-0fxi5dd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135945-38zx3jy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135945-38zx3jy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】有寒利者禁忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135946-8st5evm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135946-8st5evm"}},{"ID":"20240122135946-flcvh5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135946-flcvh5f"}},{"ID":"20240122135946-jp31smv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135946-jp31smv","updated":"20240201174740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"227我就用得多了哦。羚羊角像螺旋一样，从下面比较大，一点点长长细细的往上长，到顶是细的。现在的羚羊都是来至非洲。为什么会叫做羚羊，窜得很快啊，逮都逮不到它，所以它腿筋的力量特别强，所以我们预防在肌挛抽筋的时候使用。那你说老师一般的抽筋我们吃木瓜，对不对？对啊，得甘则缓，你吃点糖就缓掉了，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240122135952-g7bc9sk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135952-g7bc9sk","updated":"20240201174916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"还有一种抽筋，有脑瘤，癫痫脑瘤，很强烈的抽筋，平常就要配一些止痉的药，羚羊角就是一味。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们配一些止抽筋的药放在里面，比如伸筋草，羚羊角，我们在治疗脑部的疾病，脑部损伤的时候，预防病人有抽畜情况的时候，开羚羊角在里面，他就不会抽筋了嘛。我们预防他抽筋，阴症的时候我们按照辩证论治。羚羊角的使用时机最重要的就是在这里面，抽筋，拘急，所以脑伤的时候，脑部的肿瘤，脑部的瘀块，外伤等。"}]},{"ID":"20240122135957-coz45bo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135957-coz45bo","updated":"20240201174933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味道是咸味的，咸能软坚，药性是寒的，平常吃都磨粉，或者切片放在汤剂里面煮，羚羊角主治能够清热，明目，强筋骨。动物性的药，补强的力量非常强，比一般植物性的药，比起一般药来的强。防止脑溢血，都准治哦，我讲过可以预防他抽筋嘛，表面上的症状是预防他抽筋，里面可能就是预防脑溢血，我们在预防脑溢血的时候我们不用这种预防抽筋的药，脑出血的时候我们会一些川芎，丹皮，红花，藏红花，这个进去在脑部里面，让他血液循环很好，预防他脑出血。那你看【孟铣】，治中风筋挛，抽筋统统可以使用。唐容川后面讲的很好，讲羚羊的性，他是专门治疗筋缩抽扯的症状，角尤精气之所在，专主舒筋哦，所以遇到抽筋得很严重，你就要使用羚羊角，刚才我一直跟诸位强调，我个人在治疗脑瘤的时候都会使用羚羊角，就是预防他抽筋。"}]}]}